contentText:
Whoever gets the very big role of Britney Spears on the big screen will have some seriously sparkly shoes to fill. But for now, director Jon. M Chu isn&#8217;t even thinking about who might be stepping into them.

While attending the opening gala of the George Lucas Museum of Narrative Art in Los Angeles over the weekend, the Wicked filmmaker gave a small update on Universal Pictures&#8217; highly anticipated Britney Spears biopic. He made it evident that the casting search can wait, and instead emphasized the importance of telling her story correctly.

